<view class="page">
  <view class="section">学年</view>
  <view class="card">
    <view class="line">
      <text>当前学年</text>
      <text class="value">{{year}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="line">
      <text>下一学年</text>
      <input class="input" value="{{nextYear}}" bindinput="onNextYear" />
    </view>
    <button class="btn btn--ghost btn-top" bindtap="onArchive">切换学年</button>
  </view>

  <view class="section">任命新主席</view>
  <view class="card">
    <view class="line">
      <text>选择成员</text>
      <text class="value">{{selectedName ? '已选：' + selectedName : '点击头像选择'}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="avatar-grid">
      <view
        class="avatar-item {{item._id === selectedId ? 'avatar-item--on' : ''}}"
        wx:for="{{chairmanList}}"
        wx:key="_id"
        data-id="{{item._id}}"
        bindtap="onSelectChairman"
      >
        <view class="avatar-box">
          <image
            wx:if="{{item.avatarFileID}}"
            class="avatar-img"
            src="{{item.avatarFileID}}"
            mode="aspectFill"
          />
          <view wx:else class="avatar-text" style="background: {{item.avatarColor}}">
            {{item.avatarText}}
          </view>
          <view class="avatar-check" wx:if="{{item._id === selectedId}}">✓</view>
        </view>
        <text class="avatar-name">{{item.name}}</text>
        <text class="avatar-dept">{{item.deptLabel}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    <button class="btn btn--ghost btn-top" bindtap="onAppointChairman">任命为主席</button>
  </view>

  <view class="section">任命新部长</view>
  <view class="card">
    <view class="line">
      <text>学号</text>
      <input
        class="input"
        type="number"
        maxlength="10"
        placeholder="10 位学号"
        value="{{ministerNo}}"
        bindinput="onMinisterNo"
      />
    </view>
    <view class="line">
      <text>所属部门</text>
      <picker range="{{depts}}" range-key="label" value="{{deptIndex}}" bindchange="onDept">
        <view class="value">{{depts[deptIndex].label}}</view>
      </picker>
    </view>
    <button class="btn btn--ghost btn-top" bindtap="onAppointMinister">任命为部长</button>
  </view>

  <view class="tip">
    协会可有多位主席与多位部长，任命不会降级现任成员；任命后会向对方发送站内消息。学年切换只改统计口径，不会删除历史数据。
  </view>
</view>
